  "prefLabel": "Sep 701.01 Basic Requirements for Approval",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sep 701.01 Basic Requirements for Approval. The board shall approve any individual or organizational provider of pre-licensing education and fieldwork that meets the following minimum requirements:\n\n(a) Provision of at least 6 hours of classroom study in accordance with Sep 701.02;\n\n(b) Provision of at least 6 hours of field study in accordance with Sep 701.02; and\n\n(c) Administration of a written or oral exam, with a minimum passing score of 80%.\n\nSource. #13111, eff 9-24-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sep100-700.html"
}
